The entry of the MaCSad math factory. It imports every module once, as the
pinned compiler-scope workaround the macsad projects share requires, and hands
the arguments to `roles.lg`, which decides what runs.

## Main

Let outcome be dispatch(programArgs()).
Show outcome's message.
If outcome's ok is equal to false:
    Fail with "the role did not complete".
